Third-party data

The lists of club managers, national team managers, out-of-work managers and
former players in src/25-managers-data.js and the built copero99.user.js
(REAL_CLUB_MANAGERS, REAL_NATION_MANAGERS, FREE_MANAGERS and FUTURE_MANAGERS)
were compiled from
English Wikipedia (November 2026) and are available under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International license (CC BY-SA 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
If you reuse those lists, you must credit Wikipedia's contributors and share
your version under the same license.

The trophy icon is from Lucide (ISC License, https://lucide.dev).
